  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "This manhwa contains animal death(sheep). Viewer discretion is advised. \n\n**“Even if you’re here, nobody will welcome you!”**\n\n5 years ago I left my home for the city. \nMihail, who wandered around without no one to rely on, fails to settle down and eventually returns to his hometown. Which is a remote mountain valley rural village where even carts do not take you all the way. As soon as he arrived, he went back to the cabin of his one and only childhood friend, the shepherd, Caleb. He greeted him warmly, but all he got back were words demanding he leave immediately. Mihail tries to change Caleb's mind so that he can get along well in his hometown. Although, things don't go as easily as expected.."
  },
